<title>ITALY: Italy stock market open for normal hours Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Italy stock market open for normal hours Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Milan stock exchange will be open for a normal trading session from 0900 to 1600 GMT on New Year's Eve, but the bond market will close at 1130 GMT on Tuesday, spokesmen for the Bourse and MIF futures market said.</p>
<p>The local foreign exchange market will stop trading at 1230 GMT.</p>
<p>All markets are closed on New Year's Day.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
